cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Module C — Faustmann-Hartman LEV core for Korean Forest Management AI Agent"
abstract: |
  Faustmann-Hartman Land Expectation Value computation core for the multi-purpose
  Korean forest management AI agent (Chungcheongbuk-do Boeun pilot). Integrates
  KOFPI timber prices, KAU/WTA carbon market, NIFOS carbon uptake (3,212 plots),
  산림청 cost standards, IPCC 2019 HWP decay, and Korean Forest Service offset
  methodologies (8 project types). Includes 8-expert multidisciplinary
  deliberation and 2 academic findings (D114, D115).

