acknowledgements: |
  Data sources: carbonregistry.forest.go.kr (산림탄소등록부, 658 registered projects accessed
  2026-05-20); data.go.kr (Korea Public Data Portal — Forest Statistics 1400000, KAU Emission
  Trading 1160100); 산림청 (Korea Forest Service) — 2024 임산물생산조사, 2025 산림소득
  사업시행지침; 국립산림과학원 (NIFoS) — carbon uptake by species/age (3,212 samples);
  KOFPI (한국임업진흥원) — quarterly timber price reports.

  Acknowledgement to 정우 (Jeongwoo Na) for Module B/D foundational work (yield tables,
  KOFPI pricing, cost functions, 산림탄소상쇄 RAG corpus — 281 chunks from 11 PDFs).
